1
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,720
Ning,

2
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,400
if you want to visit the lantern festival,

3
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,920
Ying'er can accompany you.

4
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,850
Ying'er can also

5
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,280
ride horses, shoot arrows,

6
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,480
drink, and roll dice.

7
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,560
I can keep you company in all of these.

8
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,890
Catfights, catfights,

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,040
nothing but catfights.

10
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,370
I'm really out of ideas.

11
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,330
Watch out for the carriage!

12
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:08,560
My Lady!

13
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,610
Ning Yuanci, you dodge quite fast.

14
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,760
I was almost knocked over.

15
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,760
Are you all right?

16
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,960
How does it feel

17
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:18,860
to stand up?

18
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,039
Why are you standing up?

19
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,640
Go back and sit down right now.

20
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,100
It is exactly as I guessed.

21
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,140
You were faking

22
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,460
your crippled leg.

23
00:01:28,039 --> 00:01:29,770
You are truly shrewd, General.

24
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,960
So all of this

25
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,080
was to test me.

26
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,560
Last time you fell into the lake,

27
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,560
no one pushed you.

28
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,960
You jumped in yourself.

29
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,580
Was this poisoning

30
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,720
premeditated too?

31
00:01:41,039 --> 00:01:41,960
She...

32
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:44,000
Her legs only recovered

33
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,640
after taking the royal medicine you sent.

34
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,300
It truly is a medical miracle.

35
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,530
I had no choice but to fake my lameness.

36
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,200
As for the poisoning,

37
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,800
I am as curious as the General

38
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,920
about who did it.

39
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:57,330
If the General doesn't believe me,

40
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,320
do with me

41
00:01:58,479 --> 00:01:59,280
as you please.

42
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,280
What use do I have

43
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,440
for your life?

44
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:03,920
True.

45
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,120
If I die,

46
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,240
you won't have a hostage

47
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,740
to threaten my father.

48
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,120
Ning,

49
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,760
don't you still need to investigate

50
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,620
the poisoning?

51
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,480
Catching the culprit is more important.

52
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,640
It's getting late.

53
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,260
You should go back now.

54
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:18,880
It seems

55
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,240
I should carefully reconsider

56
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,610
the marriage contract.

57
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,400
Better keep him away

58
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,329
from Xue Ruowan.

59
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,560
Trouble will brew if they keep talking.

60
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,079
Good thing Ning Yuanci didn't dwell on

61
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:37,160
your fake limp.

62
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,480
He even said he would reconsider

63
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,280
the marriage.

64
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,040
It seems

65
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,760
your freedom is just around the corner.

66
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,820
Even though I don't want to marry him,

67
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,960
I don't want you

68
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,100
to keep tangling with him either.

69
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,130
Didn't you say yourself

70
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,840
that he's a

71
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,960
scumbag?

72
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,240
Are you really going
to keep engaging with him?

73
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:57,680
I

74
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:01,240
only curried favor with him

75
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,600
to help you

76
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,800
and clear my own name.

77
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,600
Who wants to tangle with him?

78
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,450
That's good.

79
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,120
No.

80
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,280
Is she playing

81
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,480
some new kind of female rivalry with me?

82
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:22,800
My Lady,

83
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,320
you haven't fully recovered.

84
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,240
Why must you come out

85
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,280
to meet the Second Young Lady?

86
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,210
What if you catch a cold in the wind?

87
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,160
I haven't been out

88
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,160
for a long time.

89
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,079
If I don't use these legs,

90
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,610
they will actually go lame.

91
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,240
Besides,

92
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,200
Keying asked to meet me.

93
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,120
Will the Second Miss

94
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,640
ask you out just to set you up

95
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,600
and trick you

96
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,040
like before?

97
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:45,880
She has risked her life
to save me three times,

98
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:46,840
and even kept my secret

99
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,240
of pretending to be lame.

100
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,040
I doubt she has any intention
of harming me.

101
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:51,560
Do not make

102
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,200
such assumptions about her anymore.

103
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:53,640
But

104
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,720
I am afraid she might leak your plan

105
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,240
of faking your death
to escape the marriage.

106
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,680
So,

107
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,960
we must not say this outside,

108
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,090
lest others hear it.

109
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:03,920
Then, My Lady,

110
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,770
will you marry Ning Yuanci?

111
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,840
Of course not.

112
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:07,760
I just need

113
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,280
to find the right time

114
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,140
to get out of it.

115
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,920
But I am worried about you.

116
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,080
You worry about this

117
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,080
and that every day.

118
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,080
Aren't you tired?

119
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,360
I am not tired.

120
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,800
I am willing to serve you
for the rest of my life,

121
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,640
My Lady.

122
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,160
Once I get out of this,

123
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,200
I will find a way to buy your freedom.

124
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:26,840
Then,

125
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,720
you won't have to be anyone's maid.

126
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,480
You can do

127
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,400
what you want

128
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,140
and live the life you like.

129
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,000
But My Lady...

130
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,680
All right.

131
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,880
If you really find

132
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,480
this lantern festival boring,

133
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,800
go back to the residence

134
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,000
and keep an eye on my father.

135
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Don't let him find out I sneaked out.

136
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,560
Lanterns.

137
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:16,960
Young Master Chu,

138
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,160
Wan,

139
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:22,920
Your

140
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,320
leg is healed.

141
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,370
That girl Xue Keying

142
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,560
is playing tricks on me again.

143
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,320
Lady Keying

144
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,400
wouldn't lie.

145
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,690
Does she have something

146
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,880
to discuss with us?

147
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,800
I think

148
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,080
she just wants

149
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,040
to be a puppy.

150
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:43,820
Why don't we

151
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:44,960
stroll around

152
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,530
and look for her nearby?

153
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:56,080
The Magpie Bridge Lantern Festival.

154
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,560
Such a romantic atmosphere.

155
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,240
The male and female leads...

156
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,240
You guys should take this opportunity

157
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,300
to speed things up.

158
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,080
Hurry up and get together

159
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,540
so I can reach the finale
as soon as possible.

160
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,720
Miss, take a look.

161
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,300
Look at this piece.

162
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,160
This color suits you best.

163
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:11,690
General.

164
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,620
You mean Xue Shiyan...

165
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,760
Where would he hide

166
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,620
the deer totem?

167
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:39,880
Cui Hu,

168
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,290
I'll leave you to your work.

169
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,520
All right.

170
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,280
What on earth is this?

171
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,720
Wan, what are you looking at?

172
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,280
I think

173
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,690
I heard Keying's voice.

174
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,320
General Ning,

175
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,130
You hold a high position

176
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,000
and must have

177
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,260
many official duties.

178
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,480
Why are you following me around all day?

179
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,050
I do have many official duties.

180
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,100
But I am more curious about

181
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,640
how many faces you have.

182
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:35,940
What act are you

183
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,880
putting on this time?

184
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,200
I...

185
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,120
But bringing me here

186
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:46,240
did remind me of something.

187
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:48,960
What is it?

188
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,360
Don't you know you should ask
for a girl's permission

189
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,490
before kissing her?

190
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,600
You didn't ask for my permission

191
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,200
when you kissed me last time.

192
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,840
When was that?

193
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,560
Right here.

194
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,720
Last July...

195
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,440
This Xue Keying...

196
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,820
She's good for nothing

197
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,560
but throwing herself at men.

198
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:48,800
Anyway,

199
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,400
even for the 100th time,

200
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:53,260
you have to ask for my permission
before kissing me.

201
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,160
I've done no less than

202
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,620
a hundred kissing scenes.

203
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,760
You think I'd be manipulated

204
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,220
by a fictional character?

205
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,250
Where did Xue Ruowan go?

206
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,040
This Xue Keying is really something,

207
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,840
asking us out

208
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,200
Stop!

209
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,480
and we can't even find her.

210
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,080
Don't run!

211
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,400
Miss Xue.

212
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:24,480
What is it?

213
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,010
General,

214
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,880
There was a suspicious merchant

215
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,040
holding something.

216
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,620
But I lost track of him.

217
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,660
Please forgive my incompetence.

218
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,320
Pass on my orders. Close the city gates

219
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:38,120
and carefully inspect
everyone leaving the city.

220
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,260
Xue Ruowan,

221
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,120
are you alright?

222
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,130
Where did you go?

223
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,680
Mr. Chu and I

224
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,460
looked for you for a long time.

225
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,780
Don't even mention it.

226
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:56,200
I just ran into a dog on the way.

227
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,170
It blocked my way

228
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,120
and even bit me.

229
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,360
Where did it bite you?

230
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,760
Why didn't you dodge?

231
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,080
I couldn't dodge it.

232
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,160
Why is your face so red?

233
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,960
I just ran,

234
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,260
so I'm a bit hot.

235
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,760
You really are something.

236
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,290
You asked Mr. Chu and me out,

237
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,560
but you disappeared.

238
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,180
You also invited them?

239
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,720
You also invited him?

240
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,360
I...

241
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:34,760
I.

242
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,520
I.

243
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:42,680
This is

244
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,320
an abandoned entertainment house,

245
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,880
which I have already purchased.

246
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:47,840
I plan to open

247
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,000
an immersive theater themed
around painting and calligraphy.

248
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,880
This is

249
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,040
the reason I invited you

250
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,200
and Young Master Chu out.

251
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:53,680
Theater
